    "title": "'America Is Watching': Panelists Weigh Trump's Economic Pressure on Russia",
    "text": "The White House on Wednesday said Russian President Vladimir Putin has proposed a summit with U.S. President Donald Trump. The offer reportedly came during a meeting with U.S. Special Envoy Steve Witkoff. To discuss the implications, NTD's Iris Tao sat down with Jonae Wartel, a Democratic strategist and former senior adviser to the Harris-Walz campaign, and Brian Robinson, president of Robinson Republic. They also discussed the Texas redistricting drama and a new voter ID law in the Lone Star State.\n'America Is Watching': Panelists Weigh Trump's Economic Pressure on Russia\nThe White House on Wednesday said Russian President Vladimir Putin has proposed a summit with U.S. President Donald Trump.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 8/6/2025, 11:53:32 PM EDT",
